    {
      "id": "claim_16c608cc6e684b569bdeeab8caeec305",
      "statement": "The align_citations() function accepts a backend parameter with three modes: 'auto' (attempts Rust, falls back silently), 'python' (forces pure Python SmithWatermanAligner), and 'rust' (forces RustSmithWatermanAligner, raising RuntimeError if unavailable).",
